---
import BaseLayout from "@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import AppHeader from "@/components/AppHeader.astro";
import AppFooter from "@/components/AppFooter.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About | Awesome Directories"
  description="Learn about Awesome Directories - the curated, verified launch directory list built for indie hackers and solopreneurs."
>
  <AppHeader />

  <main class="min-h-screen bg-gray-50 py-12">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">
        About Awesome Directories
      </h1>

      <div class="space-y-8">
        <div class="card p-8">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Our Mission</h2>
          <p class="text-lg text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
            Stop wasting time on dead links and low-value directories. Awesome
            Directories helps indie hackers, bootstrappers, and solopreneurs
            discover the highest-quality launch directories for their SaaS
            products.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="card p-8">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">
            Why I Built This
          </h2>
          <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
            As an indie hacker launching my own SaaS products, I was frustrated
            by outdated blog posts with dead links from 2014 and overwhelming
            lists of 400+ directories with no way to filter by quality metrics.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
            I spent 20+ hours manually researching directories, checking their
            Domain Ratings, verifying dofollow status, and testing submission
            processes. This project is my way of saving other founders that
            time.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-700">
            <strong>The goal:</strong> Help you find the top 20 directories worth
            your time in under 3 minutes.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div
          class="card p-8 bg-gradient-to-br from-orange-50 to-orange-100 border-orange-200"
        >
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">
            🏆 Featured on Product Hunt
          </h2>
          <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
            Awesome Directories is launching on Product Hunt on Friday Nov 28,
            2025, 12:01 PST. If you find this tool helpful, we'd love your
            support!
          </p>
          <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 items-start">
            <a
              href="https://www.producthunt.com/products/awesome-directories?embed=true&utm_source=badge-featured&utm_medium=badge&utm_source=badge-awesome-directories"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              aria-label="View Awesome Directories on Product Hunt (opens in new tab)"
            >
              <img
                src="https://api.producthunt.com/widgets/embed-image/v1/featured.svg?post_id=1041603&theme=neutral&t=1764313458442"
                alt="Awesome Directories - Curated launch directories for saas founders | Product Hunt"
                style="width: 250px; height: 54px;"
                width="250"
                height="54"
              />
            </a>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 flex items-center">
              Your upvote helps other founders discover this resource 🚀
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card p-8">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">
            Open Source Philosophy
          </h2>
          <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
            This project is 100% open source (Apache 2.0 License) and
            community-driven. The data is transparent, the codebase is public,
            and contributions are welcome from everyone.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
            We update directory ratings weekly via GitHub Actions, accept
            community submissions via Pull Requests, and track all changes
            publicly.
          </p>
          <a
            href="https://github.com/awesome-directories/awesome-directories"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener"
            class="btn-primary inline-flex items-center"
          >
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 mr-2" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path
                fill-rule="evenodd"
                d="M12 2C6.477 2 2 6.484 2 12.017c0 4.425 2.865 8.18 6.839 9.504.5.092.682-.217.682-.483 0-.237-.008-.868-.013-1.703-2.782.605-3.369-1.343-3.369-1.343-.454-1.158-1.11-1.466-1.11-1.466-.908-.62.069-.608.069-.608 1.003.07 1.531 1.032 1.531 1.032.892 1.53 2.341 1.088 2.91.832.092-.647.35-1.088.636-1.338-2.22-.253-4.555-1.113-4.555-4.951 0-1.093.39-1.988 1.029-2.688-.103-.253-.446-1.272.098-2.65 0 0 .84-.27 2.75 1.026A9.564 9.564 0 0112 6.844c.85.004 1.705.115 2.504.337 1.909-1.296 2.747-1.027 2.747-1.027.546 1.379.202 2.398.1 2.651.64.7 1.028 1.595 1.028 2.688 0 3.848-2.339 4.695-4.566 4.943.359.309.678.92.678 1.855 0 1.338-.012 2.419-.012 2.747 0 .268.18.58.688.482A10.019 10.019 0 0022 12.017C22 6.484 17.522 2 12 2z"
                clip-rule="evenodd"></path>
            </svg>
            View on GitHub
          </a>
        </div>

        <div class="card p-8">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Built By</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
            Hi, I'm <strong>Meysam</strong> - an indie hacker, solopreneur, and SRE
            engineer building in public. I'm passionate about helping other founders
            succeed with their launches.
          </p>
          <div class="flex space-x-4">
            <a
              href="https://meysam.io"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener"
              class="text-primary hover:text-primary-dark font-medium"
            >
              Website →
            </a>
            <a
              href="https://x.com/meysamazing"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener"
              class="text-primary hover:text-primary-dark font-medium"
            >
              Twitter →
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card p-8 bg-yellow-50 border-yellow-200">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">
            Support This Project
          </h2>
          <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
            Awesome Directories is free and will always be free. If you find it
            valuable, consider:
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-gray-700 space-y-2 mb-6">
            <li>⭐ Starring the repo on GitHub</li>
            <li>📢 Sharing with fellow founders</li>
            <li>🔧 Contributing new directories or features</li>
            <li>💝 Sponsoring via GitHub Sponsors</li>
          </ul>
          <a
            href="https://github.com/sponsors/meysam81"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener"
            class="btn-primary inline-block"
          >
            Become a Sponsor
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>

  <AppFooter />
</BaseLayout>
